{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>My Waifu Girlfriend</strong>: The Next-Gen AI Dating Simulator \ud83d\udc96!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start as a stranger, and watch as your relationship blossoms into passionate love \ud83c\udf39. With every conversation, there\u2019s always a next level of romance waiting to be discovered \ud83d\udc8c!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with your waifu, she\u2019s ready for flirtatious banter and heartfelt confessions \ud83d\ude18. Unlock new outfits to keep the surprises coming \ud83d\udc57, earn gold by engaging in fun mini-games, and show your love with thoughtful gifts. Every choice that you make leading to <strong>Your Waifu Girlfriend!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/Waifus.png?t=1743095558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>P-Chan</strong> is a church priest who has dedicated her life to serving  and guiding others on their spiritual journeys. Perhaps pure love can be the key to lifting the curse upon her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/p_chan.gif?t=1743095558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sylvia</strong> is an Elf from a magical world known as Eldoria. Why did she come to our world? Maybe she wants to capture it... <i>he~he ofcourse no, I'm kidding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/sylvia.gif?t=1743095558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aiko\u00a0</strong>acts tough sometimes, but her cuteness always shines through. Deep down, she truly values her friendships and will go out of her way to support those she cares about\u2014even if she grumbles while doing it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/aiko.gif?t=1743095558\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a few <strong>more</strong> in game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/Dialog.png?t=1743095558\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>any</strong> role you want\u2014be whoever you want to be! Each <strong>waifu</strong> is a one-of-a-kind delight, bringing her own spicy flair to every conversation. Get cheeky, get <strong>flirty</strong>, and if you ever need a fresh start, grab a dialogue reset from the shop! Your love life, your rules\u2014Be the true <strong>Main Character!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/extras/features.png?t=1743095558\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chat\u00a0</strong>Engage in natural, dynamic dialogues powered by advanced Generative <strong>AI</strong>!\u00a0\ud83d\udcac</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flirt: </strong>Girls will not mind support\u00a0<i><strong>any</strong></i> conversation!\u00a0\ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customization: </strong>Unlock new outfits for each <strong>Waifu</strong>! \ud83d\udc57</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Work: </strong>A variety of mini-games through which you can earn gold! \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gifts:</strong>\u00a0Your beloved is always happy about <strong>pleasant</strong> surprises!\u00a0\ud83c\udf81</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop:</strong>\u00a0Constant courtship is worth gold\u00a0\ud83d\ude22 But no problem! Discover new ways to earn money or invest in passive income, it all depends on <strong>your decision</strong>!\u00a0\ud83d\uded2</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Important Note:</strong>\u00a0AI answers only in English.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537920?t=1743095558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537920?t=1743095558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/e92e34f6c68c4e492edb1aa1ba5dce39930e7593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743095558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537920/e92e34f6c68c4e492edb1aa1ba5dce39930e7593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743095558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content may not be appropriate for viewing at work: \r\n- Revealing outfits"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>My Waifu Girlfriend</strong>: The Next-Gen AI Dating Simulator \ud83d\udc96!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start as a stranger, and watch as your relationship blossoms into passionate love \ud83c\udf39. With every conversation, there\u2019s always a next level of romance waiting to be discovered \ud83d\udc8c!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with your waifu, she\u2019s ready for flirtatious banter and heartfelt confessions \ud83d\ude18. Unlock new outfits to keep the surprises coming \ud83d\udc57, earn gold by engaging in fun mini-games, and show your love with thoughtful gifts. Every choice that you make leading to <strong>Your Waifu Girlfriend!\u00a0</strong>\ud